WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,800
nearly an hour

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,600
Is my share finally coming?

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
The school banquet in the corridor has been cleaned up

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:09,550
But there's something I need to tell you.

5
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:12,350
It’s okay to share 30% of the resources exploded by my team’s kills.

6
00:00:12,550 --> 00:00:15,350
But other teams and the residents in each team are unwilling to divide

7
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:17,350
They think you didn't even leave the room

8
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:19,350
Why take the resources they worked so hard for?

9
00:00:20,410 --> 00:00:21,410
it doesn't matter

10
00:00:21,810 --> 00:00:23,610
I didn't discuss cooperation with them originally.

11
00:00:23,610 --> 00:00:24,810
As long as you don't get angry

12
00:00:25,010 --> 00:00:26,410
Then can you come out?

13
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:28,010
Let's allocate resources

14
00:00:28,010 --> 00:00:30,260
but i go out

15
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:32,460
Impossible, absolutely impossible

16
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:33,660
It's too risky

17
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:35,460
Even if Uncle Xu looks okay

18
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:37,060
But there's no guarantee he's not faking it

19
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:38,890
Want to trick me into killing me

20
00:00:38,890 --> 00:00:40,090
It's up to you

21
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:41,890
Jiang Lei sets off

22
00:00:42,350 --> 00:00:43,350
What are you staring at me for?

23
00:00:43,550 --> 00:00:46,000
You don't have any bad thoughts about me, do you?

24
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,200
Not dangerous

25
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:48,800
I just need you to go out

26
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:50,000
Go get our loot.
